<title>USA: MBIA qualifies Aldine, Texas, for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies Aldine, Texas, for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said it has qualified for bond insurance a single issue scheduled for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Aldine ISD, Texas, $7.55 million public property fin. bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Muicipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
